{"id": null, "n": "0081088", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0081088", "type": "mod", "text": "Konāgamana。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[88]，今於此處加上[88]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0003001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0003001", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahāvihāra 定大迦葉尊者為最初正統派人人之止住處。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004002", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahā-atthakathā 於漢本有大義疏，昭和八年一月余遊緬甸曼達禮之古剎雖聞有貝葉之秘藏逐不能見，此應三藏之註釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004003", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahāpaccarī 大筏之義，筏中所造者謂如是名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005004", "type": "orig", "text": "Kurundī 於漢本有鳩淪陀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007005", "type": "orig", "text": "Mātikā 示項目、要目，於漢譯摩夷又目得迦，於漢本摩夷者是二部波羅提木叉，總之如 Pātimokkha 應看做律藏之 mātikā（梵語 mātṛkā）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0008006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0008006", "type": "orig", "text": "Tena samayena Buddho Bhagavā Verañjayaṁ viharati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0008007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0008007", "type": "orig", "text": "Visākhā 漢本於二月。於謹本為二月〔十五日〕見於大正24．673頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009008", "type": "orig", "text": "paṁsukula 是寫為 paṁsu 糞掃，一旦廢棄如襤褸之物而謂再造成之衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009009", "type": "orig", "text": "Nava-anupubbavihāra 謂於八成就加滅盡定。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009010", "type": "orig", "text": "Uttari-manussadhamma 亦譯為過人法，謂出家之修行。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009011", "type": "orig", "text": "Pāvā 波婆城，於漢本為葉波。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010012", "type": "orig", "text": "Sekha 亦譯為學、有學。修業中之人，對此 asekha 即是無學，完成修行之人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010013", "type": "orig", "text": "Dasabala 佛具足十之智力故稱十力。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011014", "type": "orig", "text": "Subbha-suttanta 應譯為淨經，現存之漢譯長阿含缺此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0012015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0012015", "type": "orig", "text": "茲 saṁgaha 之語，此才應譯為結集。saṁgīti 譯為此已合誦。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013016", "type": "orig", "text": "Devamanussanayanavibhaṅgānaṁ 於異本雖有 vihagānaṁ, vihaṅgānaṁ，但其意義不明。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013017", "type": "orig", "text": "Kāyagatā sati 就身起不淨想，所謂不淨行處。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013018", "type": "orig", "text": "asava 漏是煩惱之異名，如由身漏出不淨物，煩惱是漏出不淨之活動。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0014019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0014019", "type": "orig", "text": "一說者若依註，有中阿含說者（Majjhimabhānaka）之說。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0015020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0015020", "type": "orig", "text": "Ekaṁsaṁ cīvaraṁ katvā 一肩著衣，所謂左肩著衣脫右肩，漢譯為徧袒右肩。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0015021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0015021", "type": "orig", "text": "Vesālī 有為比耶離城、廣嚴城。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0015022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0015022", "type": "orig", "text": "Saṁghādisesa 於梵本 saṁghāva' seṣa、僧伽婆尸沙、僧殘由此原語而來。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016023", "type": "orig", "text": "Brahmajāla-suttanta 於長阿含梵動經有相當於此，其原本，想有 Brahmacāla 吧！"}
{"id": null, "n": "0017024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0017024", "type": "orig", "text": "Pañca-nikāya 五尼柯耶。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0018025", "type": "orig", "text": "Gahakāraka 是家之造作者，taṇhā 稱為（愛欲）之增長者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0018026", "type": "orig", "text": "\"Yadā have pātubhavanti dhammā\" 之句開始，三偈頌是最初出現於巴利律藏大品之犍度部。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0018027", "type": "orig", "text": "Udāna 感興，即興之義，佛陀的時候皆有發出歡喜之語言、韻文、散文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0019028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0019028", "type": "orig", "text": "Vinayo vinayo ti akkhāto。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0020029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0020029", "type": "orig", "text": "mātikā 茲譯為戒母，如波羅提木叉之意義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021030", "type": "orig", "text": "sutta（經）的說明，此捕來音之相通語給與種種解釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0022031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0022031", "type": "orig", "text": "abhi- 為明試其接頭語之意義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031032", "type": "orig", "text": "mātikā 說明出於前面。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032033", "type": "orig", "text": "uddāna。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032034", "type": "orig", "text": "vagga。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032035", "type": "orig", "text": "peyyāla。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032036", "type": "orig", "text": "nipāta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032037", "type": "orig", "text": "saṁyutta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036038", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036038", "type": "orig", "text": "kahāpana 迦利沙槃。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036039", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036039", "type": "orig", "text": "pāda。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036040", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036040", "type": "orig", "text": "māsaka 譯為摩沙迦、錢。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0037041", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0037041", "type": "orig", "text": "bhāra 於註有五蘊之重擔。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041042", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041042", "type": "orig", "text": "itihāsapañcama 第五 itihāsa 之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042043", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042043", "type": "orig", "text": "Citta-yamaka 此是論藏之七論中 Yamaka（耶摩迦）之一章。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0045044", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0045044", "type": "orig", "text": "kammaṭṭhāma。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0045045", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0045045", "type": "orig", "text": "bāhirakapāsaṇda 外道之譯語原依此語，其後 titthiya 應相當於此譯語。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0045046", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0045046", "type": "orig", "text": "paṇḍaraṅga-paribbājaka 亦譯為灰白支外道、普行外道，數為五外道中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048047", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048047", "type": "orig", "text": "cetiya 佛殿亦譯為廟，此與 thūpa（塔）為區別，一說後者是供佛骨、前者是供佛之衣鉢等之遺物。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0048048", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0048048", "type": "orig", "text": "catu-paccaya 衣、食、住、藥之四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049049", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049049", "type": "orig", "text": "caturaṅga-sena 四軍、四兵，即象、馬、車、步之四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049050", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049050", "type": "orig", "text": "Amaravatī。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050051", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050051", "type": "orig", "text": "pariccāga 為捨身之行，此布施（dana）之究竟者，所以譯為大布施。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050052", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050052", "type": "orig", "text": "catu-paccaya 說明出於前面。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0051053", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0051053", "type": "orig", "text": "sikkhā 戒、定、慧之三學。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052054", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052054", "type": "orig", "text": "五熱者，於身之四方焚火，此四熱與太陽之熱為五熱炙身之苦行。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0052055", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0052055", "type": "orig", "text": "太陽之由東出，沒於西止凝視之苦行法。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057056", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057056", "type": "orig", "text": "Tittira-jātaka（Jātaka, 319）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058057", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058057", "type": "orig", "text": "Kiṁvādi sammāsambuddho（等正覺者是如何之說者）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059058", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059058", "type": "orig", "text": "tatiya saṁgaha 之 saṁgaha 才相當於結集之原語，於彼 saṁgīti 是不相當於合誦之義，然本譯文明此區別。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060059", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060059", "type": "orig", "text": "Tambapaṇṇi-dīpa（銅葉洲）是今之錫蘭島 Laṅka-dīpa 即楞伽洲，Sīhala-dīpa 即稱獅子洲、獅子國，本譯文為銅鍱島。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060060", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060060", "type": "orig", "text": "諸星王，月之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061061", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061061", "type": "orig", "text": "Yona-loka 希臘殖民地之大夏地方，於漢本有「是漢地也」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061062", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061062", "type": "orig", "text": "Suvaṇṇabhūmi 於漢譯有金地國，一說是今之緬甸地方。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061063", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061063", "type": "orig", "text": "karaka-vassa 之 karaka 者，是水瓶，應如水瓶流水之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061064", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061064", "type": "orig", "text": "vāsāva, vāsāya 赤之勝，黃色而所謂樺色，此色所染之出家衣之意味，於漢本有赤衣，一見而想為赤色。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063065", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063065", "type": "orig", "text": "Āsivisopana-suttanta 漢本有犢臂喻經（Aṅguttara, IV. p. 172（手足喻）大正藏經二卷．三一三頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063066", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063066", "type": "orig", "text": "Devadūta-sutta（Majjhima, III. p. 178 大正大藏經一卷．五〇三頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063067", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063067", "type": "orig", "text": "Anamataggapariyāya-kathā（Saṁyutta, II. p. 178 大正大藏經二卷．二四〇頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064068", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064068", "type": "orig", "text": "Aggikkhandhupama-suttanta-kathā（Saṁyutta, V. p. 112 大正大藏經二卷．一九一頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064069", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064069", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahānāradakassapa-jātaka（Jātaka, 544）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065070", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065070", "type": "orig", "text": "Dhammacakkappavattana-sutta（Saṁyutta, V. p. 420）（大正大藏二卷．一〇三頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0066071", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0066071", "type": "orig", "text": "Brahmajāla-suttanta 收集 Dīgha-nikāya 相當長阿含之梵動經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067072", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067072", "type": "orig", "text": "Laṅka-dīpa 錫蘭島之古名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067073", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067073", "type": "orig", "text": "jettamūla-māsā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069074", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069074", "type": "orig", "text": "Kāḷāsoka 是 kāḷa-Asoka 即，普通言「黑阿育」之義，Asoka 即與 dhamma-asoka 法阿育之區別，一說此非別人，阿育王之前半生行殺害王子等之惡事，而取此稱為「黑阿育」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069075", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069075", "type": "orig", "text": "於原本雖有十八年，但異本有八年較正確，漢本有各八年，然而合為八年應是錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071076", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071076", "type": "orig", "text": "kaññā 茲少女依於註有剎帝利族出身之少女，想是即位灌頂之式應擔當何等之役。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071077", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071077", "type": "orig", "text": "añjana 非普通之眼藥，染黑用於目睫毛之處，漢本為安膳那藥。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0072078", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0072078", "type": "orig", "text": "visākhā 於漢本三月或二月。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076079", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076079", "type": "orig", "text": "Petavatthu 是 Khuddaka-nikāya 收集於（小部）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076080", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076080", "type": "orig", "text": "Vimānavatthu 是 Khuddaka-nikāya 收集於（小部）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077081", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077081", "type": "orig", "text": "anujānāmi bhikkhave ārāmaṁ 此是給孤獨者奉獻建立此袛園精舍，當時之佛子等，允許之語言出 Vinaya-pitaka。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077082", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077082", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahā-Meghavana 大雲林之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078083", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078083", "type": "orig", "text": "kattika 於漢本七月或八月。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078084", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078084", "type": "orig", "text": "sarīra-dhātu 之 sarīra（舍利）是身體之義，但此取為複數形時，所謂舍利即遺骨之義，想為粒形之物。dhātu（䭾都）是要素之義，但此亦取為複數形時，成為遺骨之義，於後其原來為遺骨之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0080085", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0080085", "type": "orig", "text": "Pabhejavatthu 又有 Pahecivatthu。波醯闍處之原語是 Pahejavatthu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0080086", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0080086", "type": "orig", "text": "Abhaya 無畏之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081087", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081087", "type": "orig", "text": "dhammakaraka 修行者所持之水瓶。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081088", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081088", "type": "orig", "text": "Konāgamana。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081089", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081089", "type": "orig", "text": "Vara-dīpa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081090", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081090", "type": "orig", "text": "Samiddha。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081091", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081091", "type": "orig", "text": "Vaḍḍhamāna。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081092", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081092", "type": "orig", "text": "Maṇḍa-dīpa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081093", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081093", "type": "orig", "text": "Jayanta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081094", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081094", "type": "orig", "text": "Subha-kūṭa 修婆鳩咤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081095", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081095", "type": "orig", "text": "Sabbananda 一切歡喜之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0082096", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0082096", "type": "orig", "text": "iṭṭhika 是磚。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0084097", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084097", "type": "orig", "text": "Jambukolapaṭṭhana。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0088098", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0088098", "type": "orig", "text": "Taraccha 班狼之義，王之護衛役人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0088099", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0088099", "type": "orig", "text": "Tāmalitti 多摩標渚。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0089100", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0089100", "type": "orig", "text": "Magasira。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0090101", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0090101", "type": "orig", "text": "Mahāsirisa-bodhi 摩訶沙利娑菩提樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0090102", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0090102", "type": "orig", "text": "Udumbala-bodhai 優曇鉢羅菩提樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0090103", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0090103", "type": "orig", "text": "Nigrodha-bodhi 尼俱陀菩提樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091104", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091104", "type": "orig", "text": "Tavakkabrāhmaṇa 於漢本薄拘婆羅門。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091105", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091105", "type": "orig", "text": "Rohaṇa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092106", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092106", "type": "orig", "text": "Lohapāsādaṭṭhāna。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093107", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093107", "type": "orig", "text": "Meghavaṇṇabhaya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094108", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094108", "type": "orig", "text": "Dighasuma 毘伽須摩那之毘是地之錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0095109", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0095109", "type": "orig", "text": "sīlakkhandha 謂五戒、十戒、二百二十七戒等之戒聚。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0010a0301", "type": "add", "text": "免【CB】，兎【南傳】"}
